   Purpose: verify BEFORE pinning the DELIVER wave contract that an OfflineAudioContext can boot the
   real engine (avEngineBoot offline ladder) and that timed note events can be injected with
   suspend()/resume() during the render. Probe law: platform facts are probed in a tiny scratch run
